<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH BONDS EASE WITH BUNDS, BOX TRADES ADVISED.</title>
<headline>DUTCH BONDS EASE WITH BUNDS, BOX TRADES ADVISED.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------(Snapshot at 0810 GMT)---------------------</p>
<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	106.76/86 (-0.03)	   3.73 (+0.02)</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   114.92/02 (-0.07)	   4.54 (+0.01)</p>
